@ref Annex 1, "Giá trị tài khoản hợp đồng" (src 1466)
GIVEN `the account` IS AN `Account snapshot`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Annex 1 — the contract account value of` `the account` MEANS
    `the account`'s `basic account value` PLUS `the account`'s `top-up account value`

